:"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121435.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121435.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121434\r\n\r\nAdds bindings for the topmost right click actions in the filesystem right click menu (adding 3 new shortcuts, and just setting the \"open scene\" one to what it secretly already was of \"ui_accept\")\r\n\r\n<img width=\"620\" height=\"427\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c939e1e3-426a-4053-8786-0b7bf2fd81f5\" />\r\n\r\nDemonstration of the keybinds in action (first the 3 new ones, then \"open scene\" at the end)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e4bb8d3-1c3b-4549-86b3-e4e50dc834d0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nI would also be fine with defaulting to no binding for these new ones. For me, having the \"New Inherited Scene\" shortcut is really nice for messing with fbx models.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121435/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121435/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}